Round country flags (72x72), rendered by Chesswiz from:
  - flag-icons, Copyright (c) 2013 Panayiotis Lipiridis, MIT licence
    (https://github.com/lipis/flag-icons)
  - Noto Color Emoji, Copyright Google Inc., Apache License 2.0
    (AIR, SEA, SPC, NET, EAR, FID)
  - simple drawings made for Chesswiz (historic and federation flags:
    AHO, BWI, GDR, NRD, SCG, URS, YUG, ZAN/EAZ, ZZG, ZZR)
SOURCES.txt lists the source of every file.
